00:16:47.591 --> 00:16:49.509
Ah, this is it.

00:16:47.591 --> 00:16:49.509
Oh, boy, here we go.

00:16:49.509 --> 00:16:51.010
Everyone, everyone,

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:52.763
if I may direct your attention

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:52.763
to the television.

00:16:52.763 --> 00:16:56.516
You are about to see

00:16:52.763 --> 00:16:56.516
something amazing.

00:16:56.516 --> 00:16:57.935
And then, in '72,

00:16:57.935 --> 00:17:01.062
Mickey Mantle rode my cab

00:17:01.062 --> 00:17:03.690
for the fourth time.

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:05.984
Come on, baby.

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:05.984
Bring it home.

00:17:05.984 --> 00:17:08.820
But the most

00:17:05.984 --> 00:17:08.820
exciting moment--

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:12.741
that would have to be

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:12.741
this one, right now.

00:17:12.741 --> 00:17:14.325
What?

00:17:14.325 --> 00:17:17.621
Look at me.

00:17:14.325 --> 00:17:17.621
I'm on TV.

00:17:17.621 --> 00:17:20.624
I never thought I'd

00:17:17.621 --> 00:17:20.624
have my story told.

00:17:20.624 --> 00:17:24.711
Thank you, Miss

00:17:20.624 --> 00:17:24.711
Robin Trubotsky.

00:17:24.711 --> 00:17:26.755
Thank you.

00:17:26.755 --> 00:17:28.632
<i>And right then,</i>

00:17:26.755 --> 00:17:28.632
<i>Aunt Robin realized</i>

00:17:28.632 --> 00:17:30.675
<i>how important</i>

00:17:28.632 --> 00:17:30.675
<i>her job truly was.</i>

00:17:30.675 --> 00:17:33.553
It's an honor

00:17:30.675 --> 00:17:33.553
to tell your

00:17:30.675 --> 00:17:33.553
story, Henry.

00:17:33.553 --> 00:17:35.305
You know,

00:17:33.553 --> 00:17:35.305
Metro News One

00:17:35.305 --> 00:17:38.099
may not be number

00:17:35.305 --> 00:17:38.099
one in viewership,

00:17:38.099 --> 00:17:40.602
but this reporter

00:17:38.099 --> 00:17:40.602
takes pride in...

00:17:40.602 --> 00:17:42.020
Whoa! Oh...!

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:45.189
Oh, my God, I'm covered

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:45.189
in horse crap!

00:17:45.189 --> 00:17:47.609
Oh, my... it's in my hair.

00:17:47.609 --> 00:17:49.694
You planned that?

00:17:49.694 --> 00:17:51.404
Ow, my knee! Ow!

00:17:49.694 --> 00:17:51.404
No, Marshall.

00:17:51.404 --> 00:17:54.658
That was beyond

00:17:51.404 --> 00:17:54.658
my wildest dreams.

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.286
So, if you ever

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.286
come to Alabama,

00:17:58.286 --> 00:18:01.080
my mom throws

00:17:58.286 --> 00:18:01.080
these huge crawfish boils,

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.792
and she's just dying

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.792
to meet you, by the way.

00:18:03.792 --> 00:18:05.293
Look, Natalie, there's

00:18:03.792 --> 00:18:05.293
something I have to say,

00:18:05.293 --> 00:18:06.878
and, uh, there's

00:18:05.293 --> 00:18:06.878
no good way to say it.

00:18:08.379 --> 00:18:09.840
I want to break up.

00:18:11.049 --> 00:18:12.884
I don't think

00:18:11.049 --> 00:18:12.884
you're the one for me.

00:18:13.969 --> 00:18:15.679
I don't want

00:18:13.969 --> 00:18:15.679
to waste your time,

00:18:15.679 --> 00:18:18.306
because I really like you.

00:18:15.679 --> 00:18:18.306
I want to do right by you,

00:18:18.306 --> 00:18:21.893
and I think the best way for me

00:18:18.306 --> 00:18:21.893
to do that is just to be honest.

00:18:21.893 --> 00:18:24.187
I'm sorry.

00:18:27.024 --> 00:18:28.733
Oh, God, just let it out.

00:18:28.733 --> 00:18:31.778
They're only tears.

00:18:34.322 --> 00:18:36.366
Aah!

00:18:36.366 --> 00:18:38.368
I'm not the one for you?!

00:18:38.368 --> 00:18:39.870
I'm sorry, I just...

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:41.538
I-I-I thought the mature

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:41.538
thing to do...

00:18:41.538 --> 00:18:42.622
It's my birthday!

00:18:42.622 --> 00:18:43.874
Yes, I know.

00:18:42.622 --> 00:18:43.874
I didn't realize...

00:18:43.874 --> 00:18:45.333
It's my birthday,

00:18:45.333 --> 00:18:47.293
and you're telling me

00:18:45.333 --> 00:18:47.293
I'm not the one for you?!

00:18:47.293 --> 00:18:49.295
It's really not such a big deal.

00:18:49.295 --> 00:18:52.757
I mean, the odds--

00:18:49.295 --> 00:18:52.757
it's like you lost the lottery.

00:18:52.757 --> 00:18:54.592
Oh, so dating you is like

00:18:52.757 --> 00:18:54.592
winning the lottery?!

00:18:54.592 --> 00:18:56.511
No, no, no, no,

00:18:54.592 --> 00:18:56.511
I didn't mean that.

00:18:56.511 --> 00:18:57.846
Okay, so what's the problem?!

00:18:57.846 --> 00:19:00.057
I... I... I can't explain it.

00:19:00.057 --> 00:19:01.307
Try!

00:19:01.307 --> 00:19:03.226
It's... ineffable.

00:19:03.226 --> 00:19:05.812
I'm not effable?

00:19:05.812 --> 00:19:07.772
No, no, no, no. "Ineffable."

00:19:07.772 --> 00:19:09.941
"Ineffable" means

00:19:07.772 --> 00:19:09.941
it can't be explained.

00:19:09.941 --> 00:19:11.234
Oh, so I'm stupid?

00:19:11.234 --> 00:19:12.694
Oh, God, what's going on?

00:19:12.694 --> 00:19:15.405
Okay, what's going on

00:19:12.694 --> 00:19:15.405
is you broke my heart

00:19:15.405 --> 00:19:17.240
over my answering

00:19:15.405 --> 00:19:17.240
machine

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.783
on my birthday,

00:19:18.783 --> 00:19:21.995
waited three years

00:19:18.783 --> 00:19:21.995
for me to get over you,

00:19:21.995 --> 00:19:24.247
tracked me down, begged me

00:19:21.995 --> 00:19:24.247
to go out with you again,

00:19:24.247 --> 00:19:25.832
only so you could dump me

00:19:25.832 --> 00:19:28.501
three weeks later,

00:19:25.832 --> 00:19:28.501
again, on my birthday!

00:19:28.501 --> 00:19:31.295
No, it's-it's-it's not

00:19:28.501 --> 00:19:31.295
like that.

00:19:31.295 --> 00:19:32.923
I'm just... it's-it's-it's...

00:19:32.923 --> 00:19:34.257
What?!

00:19:34.257 --> 00:19:37.510
I'm just, like,

00:19:34.257 --> 00:19:37.510
super busy right now.

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:39.888
<i>Remember when Natalie said...</i>

00:19:39.888 --> 00:19:42.515
I have my Krav Maga class

00:19:39.888 --> 00:19:42.515
in half an hour.

00:19:42.515 --> 00:19:45.435
<i>Turns out Krav Maga</i>

00:19:42.515 --> 00:19:45.435
<i>is not a kind of yoga.</i>

00:19:45.435 --> 00:19:47.228
<i>It's a form</i>

00:19:45.435 --> 00:19:47.228
<i>of guerrilla street fighting</i>

00:19:47.228 --> 00:19:48.730
<i>developed by the Israeli army.</i>

00:19:49.856 --> 00:19:51.441
(<i> grunts</i> )

00:19:54.111 --> 00:19:55.361
This is compliments

00:19:55.361 --> 00:19:56.780
of those two gentlemen

00:19:55.361 --> 00:19:56.780
at the bar.

00:19:57.822 --> 00:19:59.240
(<i> mockingly</i> ):

00:19:57.822 --> 00:19:59.240
My knee!

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:01.910
It's in my hair!

00:20:03.787 --> 00:20:06.873
But isn't it nice to know

00:20:03.787 --> 00:20:06.873
people are watching?

00:20:09.626 --> 00:20:11.335
MARSHALL:

00:20:09.626 --> 00:20:11.335
Oh, my God.

00:20:11.335 --> 00:20:12.629
Are you

00:20:11.335 --> 00:20:12.629
all right?

00:20:12.629 --> 00:20:14.213
LILY:

00:20:12.629 --> 00:20:14.213
What happened

00:20:12.629 --> 00:20:14.213
to you?

00:20:14.213 --> 00:20:16.007
I told the truth.

00:20:16.007 --> 00:20:19.677
Turns out the truth has

00:20:16.007 --> 00:20:19.677
a mean roundhouse kick.

00:20:19.677 --> 00:20:21.054
Oh, man.

00:20:21.054 --> 00:20:22.513
Oh, well, you did

00:20:21.054 --> 00:20:22.513
the right thing.

00:20:22.513 --> 00:20:23.765
I'm proud of you.

00:20:23.765 --> 00:20:25.642
I'm bleeding internally.

00:20:25.642 --> 00:20:28.394
Hey, Ted, you know what always

00:20:25.642 --> 00:20:28.394
picks me up when I'm down?

00:20:28.394 --> 00:20:29.687
Other people's

00:20:28.394 --> 00:20:29.687
misfortune.

00:20:29.687 --> 00:20:30.939
You missed something

00:20:29.687 --> 00:20:30.939
so amazing.

00:20:30.939 --> 00:20:32.356
Please,

00:20:30.939 --> 00:20:32.356
can we just have one person

00:20:32.356 --> 00:20:34.025
in this whole bar

00:20:32.356 --> 00:20:34.025
who didn't see it?

00:20:34.025 --> 00:20:35.318
(<i> sighs</i> ):

00:20:34.025 --> 00:20:35.318
Fine.

00:20:35.318 --> 00:20:36.653
Are you okay?

00:20:36.653 --> 00:20:38.529
I really thought

00:20:36.653 --> 00:20:38.529
I was doing it

00:20:38.529 --> 00:20:39.864
the good way this time.

00:20:39.864 --> 00:20:41.449
I guess there

00:20:39.864 --> 00:20:41.449
is no good way.

00:20:41.449 --> 00:20:42.951
Sometimes,

00:20:42.951 --> 00:20:45.703
no matter how hard you

00:20:42.951 --> 00:20:45.703
try to do the right thing,

00:20:45.703 --> 00:20:47.705
you just end up

00:20:45.703 --> 00:20:47.705
flat on your back,

00:20:47.705 --> 00:20:49.624
flailing around in

00:20:47.705 --> 00:20:49.624
a big pile of horse crap.

00:20:49.624 --> 00:20:50.792
You saw it?

00:20:50.792 --> 00:20:52.752
My phone gets

00:20:50.792 --> 00:20:52.752
the Internet now.

00:20:52.752 --> 00:20:54.671
(<i> chuckling</i> )

00:20:54.671 --> 00:20:56.464
It's okay...

00:20:56.464 --> 00:20:59.050
<i>And that's how</i>

00:20:56.464 --> 00:20:59.050
<i>it ended with Natalie.</i>

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:01.970
<i>No happily ever after,</i>

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:01.970
<i>just a whole lot of hurt.</i>

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:03.888
<i>And just like that,</i>

00:21:03.888 --> 00:21:07.684
<i>all those wonderful memories</i>

00:21:03.888 --> 00:21:07.684
<i>were replaced... by this one.</i>

00:21:07.684 --> 00:21:09.644
<i>But, you know,</i>

00:21:07.684 --> 00:21:09.644
<i>bad as that night was,</i>

00:21:09.644 --> 00:21:11.479
<i>within a year,</i>

00:21:09.644 --> 00:21:11.479
<i>Natalie was married.</i>

00:21:11.479 --> 00:21:13.940
<i>And now she has</i>

00:21:11.479 --> 00:21:13.940
<i>three beautiful children.</i>

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.817
<i>So that's the upside of hurt.</i>

00:21:15.817 --> 00:21:18.611
<i>Sometimes it happens</i>

00:21:15.817 --> 00:21:18.611
<i>for a reason.</i>

00:21:18.611 --> 00:21:20.613
Wow.

00:21:20.613 --> 00:21:23.700
So you got beat up

00:21:20.613 --> 00:21:23.700
by a girl?

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.827
Is that all you're taking away

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.827
from this story?

00:21:25.827 --> 00:21:28.663
You got beat up

00:21:25.827 --> 00:21:28.663
by a girl.

00:21:28.663 --> 00:21:31.249
Hey, she knew

00:21:28.663 --> 00:21:31.249
Krav Maga.